## What We Did So Far

### Phase 13: Dashboard Core ✅
- KPI queries, chart rendering, WebSocket updates, date range filters

### Phase 14: CRM Data Model ✅ (all waves)
- **Wave 1**: DB migration V182, domain types (8 modules under src/CRM/)
- **Wave 2**: API CRUD for contacts/companies/deals, 16 server routes
- **Wave 3**: RBAC permissions (V185 — 8 CRM permissions, sales role), event sourcing triggers (V186 — deal/contact events → event_store)
- **Wave 4**: Pipeline forecast refresh, stage rules/history API (already in CRM.hs)
- **Wave 5**: Domain property tests (test/Domain/CRMSpec.hs — Deal, Forecast, Types)

### Phase 15: QML Desktop Skeleton ✅
- Login flow, dashboard KPIs, CRM pages, AppImage packaging

### Phase 16: Notifications ✅
- Real Hasql DB queries against `notification` table
- createNotification, listNotifications, markNotificationRead
- sendEmailNotification (creates DB record), sendDigestNotification

### Phase 17: Reports ✅
- getPnLReport: acc_turn + acc_plan query
- getInventoryReport: goods + stock query
- generateReport dispatcher
- Wired into Server.hs: GET /api/v1/reports/pnl, GET /api/v1/reports/inventory

### Security fixes applied
- **JWT auth**: handleLogin now calls JWT.generateToken (real HS256 signing via jose)
- **authMiddleware**: validates JWT token on every request (except /api/v1/login)
- **Auth.hs**: wired to real DAL.Mutations.authenticateUser + JWT.generateToken

### Bug fixes
- Fixed duplicate `case res of` block in CRM.createDeal
- Fixed broken `recordStageTransition` encoder (was using E.noParams)
- Removed unused `Value` import from Reports.hs
- Replaced broken root app/Main.hs (referenced non-existent modules)

